{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-evap-species-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.75, step 7f. `scale-county-evap-species`: EVERY pollutant MOVES 5 associates with evaporative permeation, fuel vapor venting and fuel leaks (11, 12, 13) and refueling displacement and spillage (18, 19) in `pollutantProcessAssoc` -- THC, NMHC, NMOG, TOG and VOC, methane and NonHAPTOG at 18 and 19 (their only pairs there), benzene and ethanol, 2,2,4-trimethylpentane, ethyl benzene, hexane, toluene and xylene, naphthalene gas, and the NonHAPTOG mechanism (3000) -- for source types 21 and 62 at Washtenaw County SINGLE scale over the county database of `scale-county-idle-species` (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`), at `<aggregateBy key=\"Hour\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Hour\"/>`: July 2020, weekdays, hours 7 and 8. MOVESOutput is 54,220 rows, 27,110 per hour.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the species chain at the evaporative and refueling processes, which no earlier capture selected beyond TOG and VOC (PLAN.md §7.3.75): HCSpeciationCalculator's NMHC, NMOG, TOG, VOC and refueling methane from the process's THC (`methaneTHCRatio`, `hcSpeciation`), AirToxicsCalculator's benzene and ethanol (`ATRatioNonGas`) and the five minor HAPs (`minorHAPRatio`) as fractions of VOC, naphthalene gas (`pahGasRatio`, spillage only), and TOGSpeciationCalculator's NonHAPTOG at all five processes wherever the mechanism is selected (at 11, 12 and 13, where 88 is no pollutant-process, from the mechanism row alone).\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 27110, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs per (county, month, hour cell); `n_physicsRow` 21, the two source types' physics rows.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "evaporative",
      "refueling",
      "air-toxics",
      "hc-speciation",
      "nonhaptog",
      "mechanism"
    ]
  },
